# One run every weekday, half an hour after the market opens, once quotes have settled.
# Cron uses this computer's clock: 10:00 in New York is 07:00 in California - set yours.
# Add it with `crontab -e`, with the real path to this folder. Your computer must be awake.
0 7 * * 1-5  /path/to/wheel-bot/run-wheel.sh
